# Downloaded article corpora (news/data/<domain>/) and sweep run-logs are
# local point-in-time data, deliberately untracked — the registry CSV stays
# tracked. See the save-news-articles skill.
*/
_summaries_*.jsonl

# ⚠️ The gold set IS TRACKED, unlike everything else under a directory here.
# It is the reference every later score is measured against, so it has to be
# the SAME 240 articles on every machine and in every run — a gitignored gold
# set means each box draws its own and no two scores are comparable. It is
# derived (build_gold_set.py, deterministic from its seed) but the derivation
# reads the gitignored corpus, so re-deriving it elsewhere is not possible.
!/gold/
!/gold/**
